      "bullets": [
        "Synced passkeys tether credentials to vendor ecosystems like Apple and Google, complicating cross-platform portability and open standard export.",
        "Relying on cloud accounts for synchronization shifts attack surfaces to IdP recovery flows, diluting WebAuthn's core hardware-bound security guarantees.",
        "Enterprise security suffers because consumer synced passkeys lack device attestation and granular revocation compared to FIDO2 tokens like YubiKeys."
      ]
